WEBVTT

00:00:19.350 --> 00:00:21.820
Oh, you're still here?

00:00:21.820 --> 00:00:22.920
Yeah.

00:00:22.920 --> 00:00:26.760
Keita said he still hasn't received the things he wanted.

00:00:26.760 --> 00:00:29.160
Oh, if it's about the reward,

00:00:29.160 --> 00:00:32.960
I'll wire the money after the sun rises, no need to worry.

00:00:32.960 --> 00:00:36.470
Oh, I think it wasn't about that.

00:00:36.470 --> 00:00:38.070
What are you doing, Sebasthing?

00:00:38.070 --> 00:00:39.870
It's training.

00:00:39.870 --> 00:00:42.000
It has become my daily routine.

00:00:43.340 --> 00:00:44.370
It's useless.

00:00:44.840 --> 00:00:47.780
You could never defeat him.

00:00:48.340 --> 00:00:49.980
But you'll still fight?

00:00:51.810 --> 00:00:55.790
I'm tired of being a coward.

00:00:56.990 --> 00:00:58.190
Twenty years ago.

00:00:58.520 --> 00:01:02.160
I was a wrestler, and with martial artists and spiritual power users,

00:01:02.160 --> 00:01:04.160
I was hired by the Sindo family.

00:01:04.160 --> 00:01:08.500
We were to protect the previous family head, Miss Kei's mother.

00:01:08.900 --> 00:01:10.170
However...

00:01:10.400 --> 00:01:12.900
We never stood a chance.

00:01:12.900 --> 00:01:16.070
Not only that, he flooded my head with fear,

00:01:16.070 --> 00:01:18.910
and I couldn't fight back.

00:01:18.910 --> 00:01:20.280
And then...

00:01:20.280 --> 00:01:23.250
Are you protecting this girl?

00:01:23.250 --> 00:01:26.480
If yes, I'll kill you.
If not, I'll spare you.

00:01:26.480 --> 00:01:27.620
Which one is it?

00:01:29.850 --> 00:01:35.660
I'm...

00:01:36.630 --> 00:01:38.530
I betrayed her.

00:01:38.530 --> 00:01:41.600
Without a morsel of pride, I begged.

00:01:41.600 --> 00:01:42.930
"Help me!"

00:01:43.200 --> 00:01:45.000
Even so...

00:01:45.000 --> 00:01:48.670
She smiled and forgave this coward.

00:01:48.670 --> 00:01:50.810
She said it was all right.

00:01:50.810 --> 00:01:53.710
I have never forgiven myself ever since.

00:01:53.710 --> 00:01:54.910
It was so vexing.

00:01:54.910 --> 00:01:58.450
I've decided to protect Miss Kei, yet I can't even do that.

00:01:59.120 --> 00:02:02.720
I want to protect that little girl.
That's all I wanted.

00:02:02.720 --> 00:02:06.560
And I can't even do that. I'm...

00:02:07.920 --> 00:02:11.130
Looks like your master is important to you as well.

00:02:11.630 --> 00:02:14.230
But you know, I'm sure Keita will...

00:02:20.970 --> 00:02:22.200
Master Keita.

00:02:24.440 --> 00:02:27.210
You referred this job to me, right?

00:02:27.610 --> 00:02:30.980
I apologize.
I should've looked more into this.

00:02:31.410 --> 00:02:33.720
Even so, this is terrible.

00:02:33.720 --> 00:02:38.550
His power far exceeds the one the family head and I once defeated.

00:02:39.690 --> 00:02:43.760
He's definitely a monster.
Kind of stupid, though.

00:02:43.760 --> 00:02:44.630
Then...

00:02:44.630 --> 00:02:45.900
But you know.

00:02:47.360 --> 00:02:48.360
I don't know why.

00:02:49.000 --> 00:02:52.870
But I feel like
I won't lose to him again.

00:02:54.640 --> 00:02:58.110
Hake, I'm really mad right now.

00:03:04.110 --> 00:03:05.310
Perhaps...

00:03:06.420 --> 00:03:12.420
Perhaps I just always wanted to see that side of you.

00:03:12.420 --> 00:03:14.660
Huh, what do you mean by that?

00:03:14.660 --> 00:03:16.230
No, I just...

00:03:16.490 --> 00:03:21.560
I just want you to give me orders, Master Keita.

00:03:22.930 --> 00:03:24.970
All right, let's beat that Reaper.

00:03:30.740 --> 00:03:34.540
<i>Can I keep on praying?</i>

00:03:34.540 --> 00:03:37.850
<i>Can I keep on believing?</i>

00:03:37.850 --> 00:03:44.750
<i>Oh light that shines</i> <i>in the forest of despair</i>

00:03:55.400 --> 00:04:01.240
<i>I kick the cold ground with my toes</i>

00:04:01.970 --> 00:04:08.310
<i>My brushed hair</i> <i>dances in the moonlit night</i>

00:04:08.680 --> 00:04:14.880
<i>Let's throw away your</i> <i>frightened eyes and loneliness</i>

00:04:15.350 --> 00:04:22.720
<i>Those days when acting tough</i> <i>was your only friend...</i>

00:04:22.730 --> 00:04:27.400
<i>Leave that in the distance</i>

00:04:27.400 --> 00:04:31.200
<i>Is my salvation over there?</i>

00:04:31.200 --> 00:04:34.500
<i>Can I heal this deep darkness?</i>

00:04:34.500 --> 00:04:40.280
<i>Is it okay for me to seek warmth?</i>

00:04:40.810 --> 00:04:44.550
<i>I want to be stronger</i> <i>than anyone else</i>

00:04:44.550 --> 00:04:47.780
<i>I want to protect my loved ones</i>

00:04:47.780 --> 00:04:53.990
<i>Oh light that continues</i> <i>to shine on me</i>

00:04:55.120 --> 00:05:00.000
But to Me, it's Your Song!

00:05:07.240 --> 00:05:10.140
All right. This should be okay.

00:05:10.140 --> 00:05:11.540
Thank you, Sebastian.

00:05:11.970 --> 00:05:16.510
As you ordered, a place that is completely separated from the ground.

00:05:17.150 --> 00:05:19.750
But procuring this wasn't easy.

00:05:20.180 --> 00:05:23.820
What is the meaning of this?
What are you doing?

00:05:23.820 --> 00:05:24.920
You don't understand?

00:05:25.450 --> 00:05:30.230
Sea of Violence fights with the same technique as his opponent.

00:05:30.630 --> 00:05:33.200
So I'll fight him with this.

00:05:33.500 --> 00:05:37.100
Fight? You have experience in boxing?

00:05:37.100 --> 00:05:38.500
None at all.

00:05:38.500 --> 00:05:39.540
What?

00:05:39.540 --> 00:05:41.040
No worries.

00:05:41.040 --> 00:05:43.840
Just leave it to Keita and me, and it'll be all right.

00:05:43.840 --> 00:05:45.040
That's how it is.

00:05:45.040 --> 00:05:47.180
Oh, right. Here.

00:05:47.840 --> 00:05:49.010
You forgot this.

00:05:50.410 --> 00:05:52.580
It's too sad to leave it behind, right?

00:05:52.580 --> 00:05:53.850
Stop joking.

00:05:53.850 --> 00:05:55.580
You're fighting against him.

00:05:55.580 --> 00:05:57.750
You were beaten badly yesterday.

00:05:57.750 --> 00:06:00.020
This time you will really die.

00:06:00.020 --> 00:06:01.860
I won't.

00:06:01.860 --> 00:06:04.560
The one dying today is that Reaper.

00:06:06.760 --> 00:06:08.660
You're stupid.

00:06:08.660 --> 00:06:11.600
Really stupid.
You guys make no sense.

00:06:11.600 --> 00:06:14.570
I don't care anymore, I wanted to die.

00:06:15.000 --> 00:06:15.840
Miss Kei.

00:06:16.210 --> 00:06:20.410
You don't know how painful it is to live, do you?

00:06:20.410 --> 00:06:21.810
Miss Kei.

00:06:21.810 --> 00:06:23.080
Let me die.

00:06:23.080 --> 00:06:25.310
I don't care anymore if I die.

00:06:25.310 --> 00:06:26.520
I want to die!

00:06:26.520 --> 00:06:27.420
Miss Kei!

00:06:32.250 --> 00:06:33.360
Even you too?

00:06:36.190 --> 00:06:39.290
Miss Kei, 20 years ago,

00:06:39.290 --> 00:06:44.500
your mother bravely fought until the end against that evil Reaper.

00:06:46.770 --> 00:06:50.770
She had no knowledge of martial arts but picked up a weapon.

00:06:51.410 --> 00:06:53.880
And her husband who was an ordinary man,

00:06:53.880 --> 00:06:56.250
fought to protect her.

00:06:56.880 --> 00:06:58.250
And then...

00:07:07.360 --> 00:07:09.260
I beg of you.

00:07:09.260 --> 00:07:12.490
As her daughter, please don't speak such pathetic things.

00:07:12.930 --> 00:07:15.600
But it was useless, wasn't it?

00:07:15.600 --> 00:07:18.500
She resisted, but my mother still got killed.

00:07:18.870 --> 00:07:20.440
She couldn't win.

00:07:20.440 --> 00:07:24.140
Falling in love with father and giving birth to me,

00:07:24.140 --> 00:07:26.110
in the end, it was all for nothing!

00:07:26.110 --> 00:07:27.380
It's not for nothing.

00:07:28.480 --> 00:07:30.150
It's absolutely not.

00:07:31.650 --> 00:07:34.920
I'm sure your mother knew.

00:07:34.920 --> 00:07:37.920
Even if she couldn't do it, one day...

00:07:38.590 --> 00:07:41.490
Someone will appear to beat that Reaper.

00:07:45.130 --> 00:07:46.800
Why?

00:07:46.800 --> 00:07:49.260
Why are you willing to go that far?

00:07:49.260 --> 00:07:50.330
You want to live, right?

00:07:50.830 --> 00:07:53.340
That's what I heard from your song.

00:07:53.970 --> 00:07:56.100
That you want to live.

00:08:08.020 --> 00:08:09.820
Happy birthday, Kei.

00:08:17.690 --> 00:08:18.860
He's here.

00:08:18.860 --> 00:08:21.060
Kei, Sebastian, run away quickly.

00:08:21.700 --> 00:08:24.270
Hake and the others are on the coast.

00:08:24.270 --> 00:08:26.300
They'll take care of the rest.

00:08:32.210 --> 00:08:34.180
Miss Kei, let's go.

00:08:34.410 --> 00:08:35.740
I'm staying here.

00:08:35.740 --> 00:08:37.150
Miss Kei.

00:08:37.150 --> 00:08:40.620
Keita is fighting for me.

00:08:41.250 --> 00:08:43.350
We cannot just run away.

00:08:44.290 --> 00:08:45.690
Do whatever you want.

00:08:49.360 --> 00:08:52.160
The promised time has come, Kei Sindo.

00:08:53.530 --> 00:08:55.700
I've come to take your soul.

00:08:56.870 --> 00:08:58.130
You're too hasty.

00:08:58.130 --> 00:08:59.700
Oh, Mr. Inukami User.

00:09:00.070 --> 00:09:03.710
Do you know why
I tell the day I'm coming,

00:09:03.710 --> 00:09:06.310
and even play entrance music?

00:09:06.710 --> 00:09:09.780
Don't know. Maybe to publicize your stupidity?

00:09:09.780 --> 00:09:10.880
You're wrong.

00:09:10.880 --> 00:09:14.480
I'm giving them time to run if they want to.

00:09:14.850 --> 00:09:19.090
That way I can also enjoy cornering and tormenting an escaping prey.

00:09:19.660 --> 00:09:22.560
I admire you for not running away.

00:09:22.960 --> 00:09:26.560
Because I promised her that
I'll beat the heck out of you.

00:09:26.860 --> 00:09:29.000
Keita, I'm going to help too.

00:09:29.000 --> 00:09:31.100
This time I won't lose to him.

00:09:31.100 --> 00:09:31.970
Sure.

00:09:31.970 --> 00:09:35.070
But Yoko, there's a little change of plans.

00:09:37.570 --> 00:09:38.970
Ouch.

00:09:38.970 --> 00:09:40.040
Keita?

00:09:40.040 --> 00:09:41.910
I'll be the only one fighting.

00:09:42.340 --> 00:09:43.580
Keita?

00:09:48.580 --> 00:09:51.420
Purification Barrier Type 1,
Moon Prison.

00:09:51.990 --> 00:09:54.660
This thing has two interesting traits.

00:09:54.660 --> 00:09:58.160
First, nobody other than the caster may pass this barrier.

00:09:58.160 --> 00:10:02.900
Second, as long as the caster lives, the barrier will never break.

00:10:03.330 --> 00:10:06.570
I see. This is so
I can't get close to Kei, huh?

00:10:06.840 --> 00:10:09.940
Not really. It's so that you won't run away.

00:10:11.610 --> 00:10:14.080
Interesting, very interesting.

00:10:14.080 --> 00:10:17.410
Then I'll fight with your fighting style, boxing.

00:10:17.410 --> 00:10:19.350
Hey, don't be mistaken.

00:10:19.720 --> 00:10:22.420
I'm an Inukami User.

00:10:22.950 --> 00:10:24.350
Inukami User style?

00:10:34.500 --> 00:10:36.000
I don't really get it.

00:10:36.400 --> 00:10:39.670
But for now,
I'll fight you with boxing style.

00:10:39.670 --> 00:10:43.210
Keita, why?
It's too reckless to fight alone.

00:10:43.210 --> 00:10:45.470
Let me fight too. Keita.

00:10:58.490 --> 00:10:59.590
"Inukami!"

00:10:59.590 --> 00:11:00.620
Woof woof.

00:11:13.040 --> 00:11:15.440
Let me show you how to...

00:11:17.640 --> 00:11:19.170
Throw a real punch.

00:11:28.950 --> 00:11:32.190
Keita! That's enough.
Get out of there!

00:11:32.450 --> 00:11:34.460
It's impossible to do it alone.

00:11:34.820 --> 00:11:37.360
No, I'm not leaving.

00:11:37.730 --> 00:11:38.830
Keita.

00:11:38.830 --> 00:11:42.000
I wouldn't mind taking both of you on.

00:11:44.070 --> 00:11:46.270
Dogs.

00:11:46.540 --> 00:11:48.740
You get it, Yoko?

00:11:48.740 --> 00:11:51.240
Because of yesterday's spell,

00:11:51.840 --> 00:11:54.780
you can't fight even if you want to.

00:11:54.780 --> 00:11:57.450
Don't worry, Inukami Yoko.

00:11:57.450 --> 00:11:59.780
I'll have fun with you later.

00:12:00.320 --> 00:12:06.120
I'll drag around that trembling body, tear it up, and trample you to death.

00:12:07.190 --> 00:12:10.130
You bastard.
Why do you do things like that?

00:12:10.590 --> 00:12:14.860
Because it's fun.
Bury the family one by one,

00:12:14.860 --> 00:12:17.500
and end the family in order.

00:12:17.500 --> 00:12:19.900
There's no other game as fun as this.

00:12:20.140 --> 00:12:25.210
Then if you destroy the Sindo family, what will you do next?

00:12:25.210 --> 00:12:28.910
Simple. I will possess another family.

00:12:29.380 --> 00:12:34.120
After all, you humans are always flocking to fortune and honor.

00:12:34.120 --> 00:12:36.920
Then you make a contract with me and realize.

00:12:37.620 --> 00:12:41.060
That you sold your future for money.

00:12:41.390 --> 00:12:44.460
The deep despair born from it...

00:12:44.460 --> 00:12:47.100
It's truly a pleasure.

00:12:48.000 --> 00:12:50.400
I see. I'm so glad...

00:12:50.400 --> 00:12:53.440
That you're truly rotten to the core!

00:12:57.940 --> 00:13:03.180
Keita.

00:13:10.050 --> 00:13:10.890
Darn it.

00:13:16.660 --> 00:13:20.030
Punches are useless unless they hit.

00:13:21.530 --> 00:13:22.900
Like this.

00:13:30.670 --> 00:13:32.470
How is it, Kei Sindo?

00:13:32.470 --> 00:13:36.580
The man who's supposed to protect you is just like trash.

00:13:38.750 --> 00:13:41.950
Keita said that he would beat the heck out of you.

00:13:41.950 --> 00:13:44.190
I will trust Keita.

00:13:44.190 --> 00:13:45.550
How foolish.

00:13:45.550 --> 00:13:47.720
What can he do?

00:13:48.060 --> 00:13:50.930
He can't even hit me once.

00:13:50.930 --> 00:13:54.700
He's just taking hits like a punching bag.

00:13:55.000 --> 00:13:58.970
Mr. Inukami User is simply powerless.

00:13:59.300 --> 00:14:00.470
Stop it.

00:14:00.470 --> 00:14:02.170
Just stop it!

00:14:02.840 --> 00:14:04.940
Please stop it!

00:14:06.040 --> 00:14:07.480
Cry. Scream.

00:14:08.140 --> 00:14:08.980
Keita.

00:14:08.980 --> 00:14:11.750
Now die, Mr. Inukami User.

00:14:11.750 --> 00:14:12.950
Keita.

00:14:25.630 --> 00:14:28.100
In the name of the wise Hakusan.

00:14:29.200 --> 00:14:30.930
Frog, smash your enemy.

00:14:37.810 --> 00:14:40.880
To put a trap in your mouthpiece, how dirty.

00:14:41.580 --> 00:14:44.550
I told you. I'm an Inukami User.

00:14:44.550 --> 00:14:46.280
You really fell for it.

00:14:46.280 --> 00:14:47.620
- Incredible.
- Keita.

00:14:48.080 --> 00:14:50.450
I'm not going to die.

00:14:50.450 --> 00:14:55.090
I have a reason to see tomorrow no matter what.

00:14:55.620 --> 00:14:56.960
I'll kill you.

00:14:56.960 --> 00:15:01.100
Just now, you said there's no meaning to punches that don't hit?

00:15:01.530 --> 00:15:02.330
You're wrong.

00:15:04.230 --> 00:15:05.900
I missed on purpose.

00:15:07.370 --> 00:15:08.540
One Inch Punch?

00:15:08.540 --> 00:15:09.770
Not just that.

00:15:10.270 --> 00:15:12.070
In the name of the wise Hakusan.

00:15:12.070 --> 00:15:13.410
It can't be!?

00:15:13.410 --> 00:15:16.410
Frog, smash your enemy.

00:15:22.880 --> 00:15:24.050
Impossible.

00:15:24.050 --> 00:15:27.060
To make sure I wouldn't realize his gloves had charms in it,

00:15:27.060 --> 00:15:29.660
he purposely missed his punches?

00:15:29.990 --> 00:15:33.330
How dare you, a mere human.

00:15:34.960 --> 00:15:36.700
Hey, Sea of Violence.

00:15:36.700 --> 00:15:38.170
There.

00:15:38.770 --> 00:15:43.140
You've been making fun of humans until now, right?

00:15:43.140 --> 00:15:45.210
Where? Where are you?

00:15:45.510 --> 00:15:48.010
This time it's your turn to get beaten up.

00:15:48.010 --> 00:15:50.610
In the name of the wise Hakusan.

00:15:50.610 --> 00:15:52.150
Frog, smash your enemy.

00:16:02.560 --> 00:16:04.160
Look how sad you are.

00:16:04.560 --> 00:16:08.500
So how is the despair from facing an overwhelming power?

00:16:09.660 --> 00:16:12.500
But you can't punch with those fists.

00:16:12.500 --> 00:16:14.470
This is a bit shameful.

00:16:16.040 --> 00:16:19.710
But my proud "son" isn't actually this big.

00:16:19.710 --> 00:16:21.540
No...

00:16:21.540 --> 00:16:24.480
In the name of the wise Hakusan.

00:16:24.850 --> 00:16:27.480
Frog, smash your enemy.

00:16:27.480 --> 00:16:30.490
Impossible!

00:16:34.620 --> 00:16:35.560
Miss Kei.

00:16:37.560 --> 00:16:40.800
How's that?
This time it worked, right?

00:16:43.000 --> 00:16:44.330
No...

00:16:44.330 --> 00:16:48.570
I won't forgive you.

00:16:56.280 --> 00:17:00.250
Idiot. That's what you get for using that move in a tight space.

00:17:02.480 --> 00:17:05.650
Miss Kei, it's dangerous.
Please evacuate.

00:17:05.650 --> 00:17:06.550
But...

00:17:06.550 --> 00:17:09.060
It's fine. I won this.

00:17:09.520 --> 00:17:10.860
Keita.

00:17:11.190 --> 00:17:13.600
Sebastian, take care of Kei.

00:17:13.600 --> 00:17:15.160
Understood.

00:17:16.800 --> 00:17:18.730
We'll be waiting.

00:17:19.170 --> 00:17:20.440
Got it.

00:17:21.200 --> 00:17:22.900
Keita.

00:17:24.240 --> 00:17:28.640
Now then, let's finish this,
Sea of Violence.

00:17:34.980 --> 00:17:37.190
An order from Master Keita.

00:17:37.190 --> 00:17:41.160
The Kawahira family will protect you with all our might.

00:17:41.490 --> 00:17:44.060
- Yes.
- Do not give up.

00:17:44.060 --> 00:17:45.590
Who are you?

00:17:46.330 --> 00:17:48.960
Nice to meet you,
I am Kaoru Kawahira.

00:17:49.330 --> 00:17:52.900
Don't worry, those two will definitely take care of this.

00:17:55.670 --> 00:17:58.140
I win, Sea of Violence.

00:17:58.340 --> 00:18:02.140
What are you saying?
I'm the last one standing.

00:18:02.610 --> 00:18:05.510
You have no charms or energy.

00:18:05.510 --> 00:18:06.650
I'm the winner.

00:18:08.680 --> 00:18:10.450
No, I won.

00:18:10.450 --> 00:18:11.650
You!

00:18:12.020 --> 00:18:13.990
I won.

00:18:15.760 --> 00:18:16.790
What?

00:18:17.790 --> 00:18:19.860
I kept telling you, right?

00:18:20.300 --> 00:18:22.900
I'm an Inukami User.

00:18:23.100 --> 00:18:25.070
Impossible.

00:18:25.070 --> 00:18:28.870
That's right.
I, not Keita, set up this barrier.

00:18:29.300 --> 00:18:30.640
Could it be...

00:18:30.940 --> 00:18:33.680
I could've entered anytime I wanted to.

00:18:33.680 --> 00:18:39.050
But Keita told me to act like
I couldn't enter no matter what.

00:18:39.680 --> 00:18:41.420
Hey, Sea of Violence.

00:18:41.720 --> 00:18:45.820
I always try to make sure
Keita doesn't see this side of me.

00:18:45.820 --> 00:18:47.390
My true form.

00:18:47.890 --> 00:18:50.830
Because I was afraid about Keita knowing it.

00:18:50.830 --> 00:18:52.430
But I...

00:18:52.690 --> 00:18:54.730
I can't hold it anymore.

00:18:55.300 --> 00:18:57.500
I will not...

00:18:57.730 --> 00:18:59.500
forgive you!

00:19:00.400 --> 00:19:02.270
It can't be, you're...

00:19:02.270 --> 00:19:06.140
I, Yoko, will send you to hell.

00:19:35.640 --> 00:19:36.740
Keita.

00:19:39.940 --> 00:19:41.180
It's Yoko.

00:19:42.780 --> 00:19:44.910
- So they did it.
- Of course.

00:19:45.710 --> 00:19:48.950
I sure wouldn't want you as an enemy.

00:19:49.480 --> 00:19:50.920
Keita.

00:19:59.660 --> 00:20:02.060
Well, it worked great.

00:20:02.060 --> 00:20:05.530
When that Reaper died, the main bank went bankrupt.

00:20:05.530 --> 00:20:08.140
Stocks plummeted, villas burned down.

00:20:08.140 --> 00:20:11.270
The hotel collapsed, and all of our jewelry was stolen.

00:20:11.270 --> 00:20:14.240
The Sindo family is penniless now.

00:20:15.380 --> 00:20:16.240
I knew it.

00:20:16.810 --> 00:20:20.080
I'm sorry.
I will do something about this.

00:20:20.080 --> 00:20:23.050
I'll repay you no matter how long it takes.

00:20:23.050 --> 00:20:24.620
I won't keep my hopes up.

00:20:25.020 --> 00:20:27.660
Hey Keita, you know...

00:20:28.660 --> 00:20:30.020
What time is it?

00:20:30.020 --> 00:20:32.960
Oh, it's almost seven.

00:20:32.960 --> 00:20:35.700
What? I got to go. Later.

00:20:35.700 --> 00:20:37.470
Where are you going?

00:20:37.470 --> 00:20:39.930
Home to change, and to the promised place.

00:20:39.930 --> 00:20:41.240
Promised?

00:20:41.240 --> 00:20:43.270
Wait, you don't mean...

00:20:43.270 --> 00:20:45.940
Maiko. Wait for me.

00:20:45.940 --> 00:20:47.940
Could it be...

00:20:48.210 --> 00:20:51.950
I have a reason to see tomorrow no matter what.

00:20:53.750 --> 00:20:55.980
Keita.

00:20:56.520 --> 00:20:59.290
Wait up!

00:21:01.860 --> 00:21:02.820
Miss Kei?

00:21:03.520 --> 00:21:06.360
I absolutely swear.

00:21:06.360 --> 00:21:08.160
I will live on.

00:21:11.930 --> 00:21:14.870
This is our apartment, right?

00:21:14.870 --> 00:21:17.110
Yeah, probably.

00:21:18.470 --> 00:21:21.410
Is this because we defeated the Reaper?

00:21:21.410 --> 00:21:25.050
What the heck?

00:21:37.860 --> 00:21:43.130
<i>This and that, we want everything</i>

00:21:43.130 --> 00:21:48.500
<i>We wish for love and that all</i> <i>of our dreams will come true</i>

00:21:48.500 --> 00:21:53.640
<i>Every girl is busy.</i>

00:21:53.640 --> 00:21:58.950
<i>Playing, studying, going crazy.</i>
<i>Our schedules are filled</i>

00:21:59.480 --> 00:22:02.020
<i>When we are about to be dumped,</i>

00:22:02.020 --> 00:22:04.690
<i>we send texts and gather</i>

00:22:04.690 --> 00:22:07.290
<i>A meeting at a family restaurant,</i>

00:22:07.290 --> 00:22:10.860
<i>and nothing makes any sense.</i>

00:22:11.160 --> 00:22:13.630
<i>Oh, no. Oh, no. Oh, no</i>

00:22:13.630 --> 00:22:16.400
<i>We eat some sweets while we chat</i>

00:22:16.400 --> 00:22:21.670
<i>We can't stop, and now</i> <i>our diets are doomed too</i>

00:22:21.670 --> 00:22:24.010
<i>Oh, no. Oh, no. Oh, no</i>

00:22:24.010 --> 00:22:26.910
<i>When we go crazy together,</i>

00:22:26.910 --> 00:22:32.910
<i>we get so excited that we can</i> <i>forget our sadness a bit</i>

00:22:33.350 --> 00:22:35.720
<i>Let's go. Let's go. Let's fight</i>

00:22:35.720 --> 00:22:38.390
<i>Our hearts are one,</i>

00:22:38.390 --> 00:22:42.060
<i>tied by a strong bond</i> <i>called friendship</i>

00:22:51.200 --> 00:22:54.100
Inukami!

00:22:54.100 --> 00:22:55.040
See you!

00:22:55.100 --> 00:22:56.000
Next episode preview

00:22:56.000 --> 00:22:58.040
"Hair" is written as "long hair."

00:22:58.910 --> 00:23:03.850
When you're young, your hair will follow even your reckless acts.

00:23:03.850 --> 00:23:08.750
But one morning, you see your fallen hair on your pillow and realize.

00:23:08.750 --> 00:23:12.190
Your youth has passed, the past will never come back.

00:23:12.190 --> 00:23:16.560
Come back, my upper head.
My shiny black hair.

00:23:17.090 --> 00:23:18.960
Next on Inukami!

00:23:18.960 --> 00:23:20.760
"Kappa and Dad!"

00:23:20.760 --> 00:23:25.070
Society is cold to Kappa monsters and middle-aged men.
